//    anything, or anybody."
//
//   The W-1 transport-tier ladder adds 16 ABI-locked symbols + their
//   typed CSSL wrappers. Every wrapper consumes Cap<Gpu> via caps_check.
//   Every per-frame hot-path wrapper carries the Deadline<6944us> 144hz
//   marker. Buffer IFC labels remain Public default ; Sensitive<Frame>
//   for output backbuffers on the VR path (preserved from stdlib/gpu.cssl).
//
//   The 1440p / 144 Hz / 1M-entity Apocky-mandate REQUIRES this transport
//   ladder : T0 push-constants for per-frame vp + frame_idx (8 ms saved
//   over UBO route at high frame-rate) · T2 SSBO for InstanceData[1M] (the
//   only viable transport for that size) · T3 indirect-draw + T4 compute-
//   dispatch for GPU-driven cull (the only way to keep CPU at <1ms/frame
//   under 1M entities · per §A6 transcript-distill).
//
//   No surveillance. No PRIME_DIRECTIVE override. The 16 symbols are
//   append-only ; the existing 8 verbs are preserved verbatim.
